.Dd August 30, 2026
.Dt OPENPROJECT.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openproject.conf
.Nd CloudBSD OpenProject JSON configuration
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The file
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json
is the operator configuration for
.Xr openproject 8 .
It is JSON.
OpenProject does not read this file; the helper writes official
environment variables from it.
.Pp
A sample is installed as
.Pa config.json.sample .
Copy it and fill the secret file paths.
Never store
.Li SECRET_KEY_BASE
or the database password in the JSON document; use mode 0600 files.
.Sh KEYS
.Bl -tag -width memcached
.It Va version
Packaged OpenProject version string
.Pq 17.7.2 .
.It Va bind.address , Va bind.port
Puma listen address and port.
Track uses
.Li 127.0.0.1
and
.Li 3000 .
.It Va host_name
Public hostname.
Becomes
.Ev OPENPROJECT_HOST__NAME .
Default
.Li track.cloudbsd.org .
.It Va https
Boolean.
Becomes
.Ev OPENPROJECT_HTTPS .
Must be true when nginx sends
.Li X-Forwarded-Proto: https .
.It Va default_language
Becomes
.Ev OPENPROJECT_DEFAULT__LANGUAGE .
.It Va rails_env
Rails environment.
Default
.Li production .
.It Va wwwdir
Application root.
Default
.Pa %%WWWDIR%% .
.It Va secret_key_base_file
Path of a mode 0600 file containing
.Li SECRET_KEY_BASE .
.It Va postgres.host , Va postgres.port , Va postgres.database , Va postgres.user
PostgreSQL 16 or 17 connection.
Combined with
.Va postgres.password_file
into
.Ev DATABASE_URL .
.It Va postgres.password_file
Path of a mode 0600 file containing the database password.
.It Va memcached.enabled
If true, set
.Ev OPENPROJECT_RAILS__CACHE__STORE
to
.Li memcache .
.It Va memcached.server
Host:port for
.Ev OPENPROJECT_CACHE__MEMCACHE__SERVER .
Default
.Li 127.0.0.1:11211 .
.It Va nginx.enabled
Documented for
.Nm doctor .
nginx itself is configured from
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/nginx/openproject.conf.sample .
.It Va nginx.x_forwarded_proto
Must be
.Li https
on track.cloudbsd.org.
.It Va data_dir
Attachment and home directory.
Default
.Pa /var/db/openproject .
.It Va log_dir
Log directory.
Default
.Pa /var/log/openproject .
.It Va pidfile
rc.d pidfile.
Default
.Pa /var/run/openproject/openproject.pid .
.It Va user
Service user.
Default
.Li openproject .
.It Va extra_env
Object of additional string environment variables copied into the
env file.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent -compact
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json
Live configuration.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json.sample
Installed sample.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/secret_key_base
Recommended secret path.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/postgres.password
Recommended password path.
.It Pa /var/db/openproject/env
Generated env file
.Pq mode 0600 .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openproject 8
.Sh AUTHORS
This manual page was written for CloudBSD by
.An Mark LaPointe Aq Mt mark@cloudbsd.org .
